        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: मधुमेह",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मधुमेह — madhumeh — \"diabetes\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मधुमेहामुळे आजोबा साखर खात नाहीत. madhumehāmuḷe ājobā sākhar khāt nāhīt. Grandfather does not eat sugar because of his diabetes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मधु, honey, + मेह, urine: an old name for the sugar sickness."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मधुमेह (madhumeh) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit madhumeha, \"honey-like urine, diabetes\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
