          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रक्तदाब (raktadāb) is a modern Marathi compound of रक्त, \"blood\", a tatsama of Sanskrit rakta (CDIAL 10539), and दाब, \"pressure\", the noun of दाबणे."
